{"id":"q6pacruh2evi6b84bx23guu6l","title":"金兰：古代文献中表达深厚友情与结拜关系的词语","originalTitle":"古代文献常用（今人费解）词语（159）：金兰","summary":"\"金兰\"本义由\"断金\"和\"如兰\"两个比喻凝练而来，指友情坚固、同心相契，后也指结拜兄弟或姐妹。该词源于《周易·系辞上》中的\"二人同心，其利断金；同心之言，其臭如兰\"，后世称结拜为\"义结金兰\"。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1561757"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T01:44:15.249Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T01:44:15.249Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":5,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}